This package contains code derived from RFdiffusion, and its released model
files are derived from RFdiffusion's model weights:

  - src/crimm_ml/minimal_rf/   a reduced copy of RFdiffusion's network and
                               inference code, with the DGL/e3nn SE(3)-Transformer
                               replaced by a pure-PyTorch version
  - src/crimm_ml/numpy_rf/     NumPy ports of RFdiffusion's diffusion code
  - src/crimm_ml/minimal_loop_sampler.py, minimal_rf_module.py,
    minimal_track_module.py    reduced transcriptions of RFdiffusion's sampler
                               and model
  - src/crimm_ml/data/base.yaml  RFdiffusion's config/inference/base.yaml
  - the ONNX model files distributed separately for this package

